=======
Script automatically:
1. Pre-flight: clean working dir; main branch.
2. Update all `package.json` versions.
3. Regenerate `bun.lock`.
4. Update CHANGELOGs: `[Unreleased] → [version] - date`.
5. Commit and tag.
6. Push to origin.
7. Watch CI until all workflows pass.

